# Beast Master — a Strong enemy of the 1997 game, the deck as the original shipped it.
# tier: 8/12 Strong enemies — 22 life, bribe 100 gold
# enemy: Beastmaster — the 1997 in-game name (s30/assets/text/Advstrings.txt @CREATURENAMES); the deck file, s30 and the wiki call it "Beast Master"
# designer: Coyote Tex, MicroProse designer/producer — every enemy deck (precon page, ref. 2)
# variant: Original (base game; the enemy deck files are dated 19 September 1996)
# source: ../shandalar-src/Decks.zip:Decks/0170.dck "Beast Master (G, 4th)" [Tier 3 — Manalink 3
#   file dated 2016-02-15; its first 13 maindeck lines are the 1997 deck, the 12 lines (60
#   cards) after them are the modern deck Manalink appended and are NOT shipped; its
#   .vNone/.v<Colour> sections are the 1997 colour-keyed swaps]
# source: ../s30/assets/configs/rogues/beast_master.toml (main_cards, sideboard_cards, level 8)
#   [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix above]
# source: ../mage-go/rogue_dck/beast_master.dck [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix]
# cross-check: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Enemy_Decks_(Strong) — "Beast Master" (Original)
#   [Tier-web — maindeck agrees]
# group: 1997 originals
name: Beast Master
21 Forest
2 Birds of Paradise
4 Timber Wolves
4 Nafs Asp
4 Grizzly Bears
3 Stream of Life
4 Aspect of Wolf
4 Aswan Jaguar
2 Durkwood Boars
4 Giant Growth
2 Web
2 Untamed Wilds
2 Giant Spider
2 Desert Twister
# The 1997 file's colour-keyed sideboard sections. The AI played the maindeck WITHOUT
# .vNone plus the one section matching the player's deck colour (.vNone by default);
# .vNone is folded into the maindeck above, and SB: holds, per name, the largest
# colour-section count minus the .vNone count — the smallest sideboard from which
# every 1997 configuration can be rebuilt by swapping.
#   .vNone   2 Desert Twister, 1 Stream of Life
#   .vBlack  2 Desert Twister, 1 Stream of Life
#   .vBlue   1 Tsunami, 2 Desert Twister
#   .vGreen  2 Desert Twister, 1 Stream of Life
#   .vRed    2 Desert Twister, 1 Stream of Life
#   .vWhite  2 Desert Twister, 1 Tranquility
SB: 1 Tsunami
SB: 1 Tranquility
